NOTICES & THIRD-PARTY ATTRIBUTION

This skill is a modification, merger, and extension of the following existing skill projects:
- sega-genesis-sgdk-skill-for-claude (https://github.com/haroldo-ok/sega-genesis-sgdk-skill-for-claude)
- sega-32x-skill-for-claude (https://github.com/haroldo-ok/sega-32x-skill-for-claude)

This skill also combines, refines, and extends knowledge, templates, and tools from
multiple established open-source projects and authors across the Sega development
community. Individual components remain subject to their respective original
licenses and copyright notices:

