10. Research Notes & Specifications
   - High-level architectural and design notes (e.g. Sonic 1 Pattern Load Cues, Sega VR dual-CPU timing, DOOM 32X dual-SH2 rendering concepts) are included for educational reference only.
   - Sources from Nuked-OPN2, Furnace Tracker, Sonic the Hedgehog 1 Disassembly, Sega VR Disassembly, and Jaguar DOOM are NOT included and have been explicitly excluded and removed from this repository and skill.
   - VGM (Video Game Music) Specification: Open community technical specification and reference standard documented at https://vgmrips.net/wiki/VGM_Specification (Unrestricted / Public Reference).

